            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Modern production plant.\n\n# Included processes\nProduction of the cell matrix, cutting of foils and washing of glass, production of laminate, isolation. Aluminium frame of the panel. Disposal after end of life. Data for direct air and water emissions were not available. It can be expected that small amount of NMVOC will be emitted from the lamination process.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
